---
// The site's one drawing of a pregnant person and baby, used everywhere one appears
// (both versions of "How Zika spreads"). Drawn for Outbite and traced to SVG:
// navy body, peach #F4D1A8 baby circle, the baby kept exactly as in the file). Drawn in
// the file's own 576 × 758 space, standing with its feet at (x, y), `height` units tall
// (so it can match the story person's height). The site's content checks keep it the only
// drawing of a pregnant person or baby. Exports the dotted line's anchor points:
// at row 650 (just under the hands, which end at row 630) the baby circle's right edge is
// x 417 and the dress's right edge x 475.
interface Props {
  x: number;
  y: number;
  height: number;
}
const { x, y, height } = Astro.props;
const k = height / 758;
---

